 هو Async-Drop؟ هو نمط في Rust للتنظيف التزامني للموارد"},"features":{"en":["Wraps values in AsyncDropGuard<T> for async cleanup","Requires explicit async_drop().await calls for resource management","Panics if cleanup is forgotten to ensure secure resource handling","Utilizes Rust''s Drop trait for synchronous cleanup","Enables async cleanup for network connections and file handles","Supports background tasks for asynchronous teardown"],"zh":["支持异步清理和资源释放","使用Rust的Drop trait实现非同期 teardown","要求显式async_drop().await调用","panic如果清理被遗忘","支持网络连接和文件句柄的异步关闭"],"ja":["非同期クリーンアップとリソースの解放をサポート","RustのDrop traitを使用して非同期teardownを実現","async_drop().awaitの明示的な呼び出しを要求","クリーンアップが忘れられた場合はpanic","ネットワーク接続とファイルハンドルの非同期クローズをサポート"],"ko":["비동기 정리 및 리소스 해제를 지원","Rust의 Drop trait를 사용하여 비동기 teardown을 구현","async_drop().await의 명시적 호출을 요구","정리가 잊어버리면 panic","네트워크 연결 및 파일 핸들의 비동기 닫기를 지원"],"es":["Permite la limpieza asíncrona de recursos","Utiliza el patrón AsyncDropGuard para envolver valores","Requiere llamadas explícitas a async_drop().await","Panickea si se olvida la limpieza","Es compatible con Rust"],"fr":["Permet le nettoyage asynchrone des ressources","Utilise le modèle AsyncDropGuard pour envelopper les valeurs","Exige des appels explicites à async_drop().await","Panicke si le nettoyage est oublié","Est compatible avec Rust"],"de":["Ermöglicht die asynchrone Bereinigung von Ressourcen","Verwendet das Muster AsyncDropGuard, um Werte zu umschließen","Erfordert explizite Aufrufe von async_drop().await","Panicke, wenn die Bereinigung vergessen wird","Ist kompatibel mit Rust"],"pt":["Suporte a limpeza assíncrona de recursos","Uso do trait Drop em Rust","Requisito de chamadas explícitas de async_drop().await","Pânico em caso de esquecimento da limpeza","Uso de AsyncDropGuard<T> para envolver valores"],"ru":["Поддержка асинхронной очистки ресурсов","Использование трейта Drop в Rust","Требование явных вызовов async_drop().await","Паника в случае забытой очистки","Использование AsyncDropGuard<T> для обёртки значений"],"ar":["دعم تنظيف التزامني للموارد","استخدام سمة Drop في Rust","طلب呼وات明确ة async_drop().await","ذعر في حالة نسيان التنظيف","استخدام AsyncDropGuard<T> لتحويل القيم"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use async-drop","async-drop setup guide","async-drop vs synchronous cleanup","async-drop install for cloud filesystems","what is async-drop pattern","async-drop alternative for resource management","async-drop and Rust''s Drop trait","async-drop for cryptographic filesystems","async-drop async cleanup example"],"zh":["Async-Drop","加密文件系统","云存储","异步清理","Rust","Drop trait","非同期teardown","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Async-Drop","暗号化ファイルシステム","クラウドストレージ","非同期クリーンアップ","Rust","Drop trait","非同期teardown","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Async-Drop","암호화 파일 시스템","클라우드 저장소","비동기 정리","Rust","Drop trait","비동기 teardown","AI 에이전트"],"es":["async-drop","limpieza asíncrona","Rust","patrón de diseño","AsyncDropGuard","recursos asíncronos","programación asíncrona","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["async-drop","nettoyage asynchrone","Rust","modèle de conception","AsyncDropGuard","ressources asynchrones","programmation asynchrone","outils de développement"],"de":["async-drop","asynchrone Bereinigung","Rust","Entwurfsmuster","AsyncDropGuard","asynchrone Ressourcen","asynchrone Programmierung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["Async-Drop","Rust","limpeza assíncrona","recursos","trait Drop","async_drop","programação","desenvolvedores","guia de configuração"],"ru":["Async-Drop","Rust","асинхронная очистка","ресурсы","трейт Drop","async_drop","программирование","разработчики","ИИ Агенты","руководство по настройке"],"ar":["Async-Drop","Rust","تنظيف التزامني","الموارد","سمة Drop","async_drop","البرمجة","المطورون","عاملون بالبرمجة","دليل الإعداد"]}},"owner":"cryfs","repo":"cryfs","repoPath":"cryfs/cryfs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.291Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"async-drop","description":"Guide to the AsyncDrop pattern for async cleanup in Rust. Use when working with AsyncDropGuard, implementing AsyncDrop trait, or handling async resource cleanup.","bodyPreview":"# AsyncDrop Pattern Guide\n\nThe AsyncDrop pattern enables async cleanup for types that hold resources requiring asynchronous teardown (network connections, file handles, background tasks, etc.).\n\n## Core Concept\n\nRust''s `Drop` trait is synchronous, but sometimes cleanup needs to be async. The AsyncDrop pattern solves this by:\n\n1. Wrapping values in `AsyncDropGuard<T>`\n2. Requiring explicit `async_drop().await` calls\n3. Panicking if cleanup is forgotten\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```rust\n// Creating\nlet","body":"# AsyncDrop Pattern Guide\n\nThe AsyncDrop pattern enables async cleanup for types that hold resources requiring asynchronous teardown (network connections, file handles, background tasks, etc.).\n\n## Core Concept\n\nRust''s `Drop` trait is synchronous, but sometimes cleanup needs to be async. The AsyncDrop pattern solves this by:\n\n1. Wrapping values in `AsyncDropGuard<T>`\n2. Requiring explicit `async_drop().await` calls\n3. Panicking if cleanup is forgotten\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```rust\n// Creating\nlet mut guard = AsyncDropGuard::new(my_value);\n\n// Using (transparent via Deref)\nguard.do_something();\n\n// Cleanup (REQUIRED before dropping)\nguard.async_drop().await?;\n```\n\n## The AsyncDrop Trait\n\n```rust\n#[async_trait]\npub trait AsyncDrop {\n    type Error: Debug;\n    async fn async_drop_impl(&mut self) -> Result<(), Self::Error>;\n}\n```\n\n## Essential Rules\n\n| Rule | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| **Always call async_drop()** | Every `AsyncDropGuard` must have `async_drop()` called |\n| **Factory methods return guards** | `fn new() -> AsyncDropGuard<Self>`, never plain `Self` |\n| **Types with guard members impl AsyncDrop** | Delegate to member async_drops |\n| **Use the macro when possible** | `with_async_drop_2!` handles cleanup automatically |\n| **Panics are exceptions** | It''s OK to skip async_drop on panic paths |\n\n## The `with_async_drop_2!` Macro\n\nAutomatically calls `async_drop()` on scope exit:\n\n```rust\nlet resource = get_resource().await?;\nwith_async_drop_2!(resource, {\n    // Use resource here\n    resource.do_work().await?;\n    Ok(result)\n})\n```\n\n## Additional References\n\n- [patterns.md](patterns.md) - Implementation patterns and examples\n- [gotchas.md](gotchas.md) - Common mistakes and how to avoid them\n- [helpers.md](helpers.md) - Helper types (AsyncDropArc, AsyncDropHashMap, etc.)\n\n## Location\n\nImplementation: `crates/utils/src/async_drop/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:01.178Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Rust-based AI Agents requiring asynchronous resource management and cleanup for cloud-based applications","zh":"适用于需要异步资源管理和清理的基于Rust的AI代理的云端应用程序","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントがクラウドベースのアプリケーションで非同期リソース管理とクリーンアップを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"클라우드 기반 응용 프로그램에서 비동기 리소스 관리 및 정리 필요한 러스트 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para AI Agents basados en Rust que requieren gestión y limpieza asíncrona de recursos para aplicaciones basadas en la nube","fr":"Idéal pour les AI Agents basés sur Rust nécessitant une gestion et un nettoyage asynchrones des ressources pour des applications basées sur le cloud","de":"Ideal für Rust-basierte AI Agents, die asynchrones Ressourcenmanagement und Cleanup für cloudbasierte Anwendungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Rust que exigem gerenciamento de recursos assíncronos e limpeza para aplicações baseadas em nuvem","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, требующих асинхронного управления ресурсами и очистки для облачных приложений","ar":"مثالي لعميل ذكاء اصطناعي يستند إلى الرست ويحتاج إلى إدارة موارد متزامنة وتنظيف للتطبيقات السحابية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle async cleanup for types holding resources with AsyncDropGuard, ensuring reliable asynchronous teardown of network connections, file handles, and background tasks using Rust''s Drop trait","zh":"赋予代理使用AsyncDropGuard处理异步清理持有资源的类型的能力，确保使用Rust的Drop特性可靠地异步关闭网络连接、文件句柄和后台任务","ja":"AsyncDropGuardを使用してリソースを保持する型の非同期クリーンアップを処理するエージェントの能力を与え、RustのDrop特性を使用してネットワーク接続、ファイルハンドル、およびバックグラウンドタスクの信頼性の高い非同期解除を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 AsyncDropGuard를 사용하여 리소스를 보유하는 유형의 비동기 정리를 처리할 수 있도록 하여 러스트의 드롭 특성을 사용하여 네트워크 연결, 파일 핸들 및 백그라운드 작업의 안정적인 비동기 해제를 보장","es":"Permite a los agentes manejar la limpieza asíncrona para tipos que contienen recursos con AsyncDropGuard, garantizando una desinstalación asíncrona confiable de conexiones de red, manejadores de archivos y tareas en segundo plano utilizando el trait Drop de Rust","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer le nettoyage asynchrone pour les types détenant des ressources avec AsyncDropGuard, garantissant une désinstallation asynchrone fiable des connexions réseau, des handles de fichiers et des tâches en arrière-plan en utilisant le trait Drop de Rust","de":"Ermöglicht Agents die asynchrone Bereinigung von Typen, die Ressourcen halten, mit AsyncDropGuard, und gewährleistet so einen zuverlässigen asynchronen Abbau von Netzwerkverbindungen, Datei-Handles und Hintergrundtasks unter Verwendung von Rusts Drop-Trait","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidarem com a limpeza assíncrona para tipos que seguram recursos com AsyncDropGuard, garantindo a desmontagem assíncrona confiável de conexões de rede, manipuladores de arquivos e tarefas em segundo plano usando a trait Drop do Rust","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать асинхронную очистку для типов, удерживающих ресурсы с AsyncDropGuard, обеспечивая надежный асинхронный teardown сетевых подключений, файловых дескрипторов и фоновых задач с помощью трейта Drop в Rust","ar":"يتمكّن العميل من التعامل مع التنظيف المتزامن للأصناف التي تحتفظ بالمصادر باستخدام AsyncDropGuard، مما يضمن تفكيك متزامن موثوق به للاتصالات الشبكية ومعالجات الملفات والمهام الخلفية باستخدام سمة Drop في الرست"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing async cleanup for cloud-based filesystems","Managing async resource teardown for network connections","Ensuring reliable background task cleanup"],"zh":["为基于云的文件系统实现异步清理","管理网络连接的异步资源解除","确保可靠的后台任务清理"],"ja":["クラウドベースのファイルシステムの非同期クリーンアップを実装する","ネットワーク接続の非同期リソース解除を管理する","信頼性の高いバックグラウンドタスクのクリーンアップを確保する"],"ko":["클라우드 기반 파일 시스템의 비동기 정리를 구현","네트워크 연결의 비동기 리소스 해제 관리","안정적인 백그라운드 작업 정리를 보장"],"es":["Implementar limpieza asíncrona para sistemas de archivos basados en la nube","Gestionar la desinstalación asíncrona de recursos para conexiones de red","Garantizar una limpieza confiable de tareas en segundo plano"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre du nettoyage asynchrone pour les systèmes de fichiers basés sur le cloud","Gestion de la désinstallation asynchrone des ressources pour les connexions réseau","Assurance d''un nettoyage fiable des tâches en arrière-plan"],"de":["Implementierung von asynchronem Cleanup für cloudbasierte Dateisysteme","Verwaltung des asynchronen Ressourcenabbaus für Netzwerkverbindungen","Gewährleistung einer zuverlässigen Bereinigung von Hintergrundtasks"],"pt":["Implementação de limpeza assíncrona para sistemas de arquivos baseados em nuvem","Gerenciamento de teardown de recursos assíncronos para conexões de rede","Garantia de limpeza confiável de tarefas em segundo plano"],"ru":["Реализация асинхронной очистки для облачных файловых систем","Управление асинхронным teardown ресурсов для сетевых подключений","Обеспечение надежной очистки фоновых задач"],"ar":["تنفيذ تنظيف متزامن لأنظمة ملفات السحابية","إدارة إيقاف تشغيل متزامن للموارد للاتصالات الشبكية","ضمان تنظيف موثوق للمهام الخلفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming language","Explicit async_drop().await calls are mandatory","Panics if cleanup is forgotten"],"zh":["需要Rust编程语言","显式的async_drop().await调用是必需的","如果清理被遗忘，则会发生panic"],"ja":["Rustプログラミング言語が必要","明示的なasync_drop().await呼び出しが必須","クリーンアップが忘れられた場合、パニックが発生する"],"ko":["러스트 프로그래밍 언어가 필요","명시적인 async_drop().await 호출이 필수","정리가 잊어버리면 패닉이 발생"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Rust","Las llamadas explícitas a async_drop().await son obligatorias","Entra en pánico si se olvida la limpieza"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Rust","Les appels explicites async_drop().await sont obligatoires","Panique si le nettoyage est oublié"],"de":["Erfordert die Programmiersprache Rust","Explizite async_drop().await Aufrufe sind zwingend erforderlich","Führt zu einem Panic, wenn das Cleanup vergessen wird"],"pt":["Exige a linguagem de programação Rust","Chamadas explícitas para async_drop().await são obrigatórias","Pânico se a limpeza for esquecida"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Rust","Явные вызовы async_drop().await обязательны","Паника, если очистка забыта"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة البرمجة الرست","الاستدعاءات الصريحة ل async_drop().await إجبارية","ذعر إذا ما 忽略 التنظيف"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"54e5fa7b617c82bcdefdf7f39abb3d7dcda5436deb25ba8a1814a335b341792a","qualityScore":30}');
