INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('dupipcom/morpheus/the-linter', 'the-linter', 'dupipcom', 'morpheus', 'community', 'the-linter dupipcom morpheus community The the-linter skill helps code quality engineers maintain clean, consistent, and type-safe code by running ESLint checks and fixing errors. It benefits developers working on Dupip Monorepo projects. the-linter 是一个自动检测和修复 TypeScript 错误、ESLint 规则违反和未使用的导入的工具 the-linter は、ESLint チェックとエラー修復を自動化するツールです the-linter는 TypeScript 오류, ESLint 규칙 위반 및 미사용 된 가져오기를 자동으로 감지하고 수정하는 도구입니다 the-linter es una herramienta para mantener un código limpio y consistente, utilizando ESLint para identificar errores y advertencias the-linter est un outil pour maintenir un code propre et cohérent, utilisant ESLint pour identifier les erreurs et les avertissements the-linter ist ein Tool, um einen sauberen und konsistenten Code zu halten, indem ESLint verwendet wird, um Fehler und Warnungen zu identifizieren O the-linter é uma ferramenta para melhorar a qualidade do código, executando verificações de ESLint e corrigindo erros de forma sistemática. ИИ Агент the-linter - это инструмент для улучшения качества кода, выполняющий проверки ESLint и исправляющий ошибки систематически. العامل الذكي the-linter هو أداة لتحسين جودة الكود، يقوم بتنفيذ عمليات فحص ESLint وتصحيح الأخطاء بشكل منهجي. how to use the-linter the-linter setup guide the-linter vs ESLint the-linter install what is the-linter the-linter alternative npm run lint command TypeScript type errors ESLint rule violations the-linter TypeScript 错误检测 ESLint 检查 代码质量工程 自动化代码修复 AI 工具 代码检查工具 Runs ESLint checks using npm run lint command Identifies and groups TypeScript type errors, ESLint rule violations, and unused imports/variables Fixes errors in priority order, starting with type errors Supports systematic fixing of missing dependencies Executes commands like 2>&1 | head -200 for error analysis the-linter is a code quality tool that runs ESLint checks, identifies errors, and systematically fixes them to ensure consistent and type-safe code.');
