de diseño","agentes de ia","diseño responsivo","paletas de colores","gradientes de colores","diseño móvil","experiencia de usuario","apariencia profesional"],"fr":["amélioration de la conception","outils d''ia","conception responsable","palettes de couleurs","gradations de couleurs","conception mobile","expérience utilisateur","apparence professionnelle"],"de":["design-verbesserung","ki-agents","responsives design","farbpaletten","farbverläufe","mobiles design","benutzererfahrung","professionelles aussehen"],"pt":["melhoria de design","otimização de layout","design responsivo","consistência de design","princípios de design de projeto","ferramentas de design","guias de design"],"ru":["улучшение дизайна","оптимизация макета","адаптивный дизайн","последовательность дизайна","принципы дизайна проекта","инструменты дизайна","руководства по дизайну"],"ar":["تحسين التصميم","تحسين التصميم","تصميم استجابة","التصميم المتسق","مبادئ تصميم المشروع","أدوات التصميم","دلائل التصميم"]}},"owner":"Youngger9765","repo":"young-personal-site","repoPath":"Youngger9765/young-personal-site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.309Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-improvement","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Design Improvement Skill\n\n## Purpose\nStreamline design optimization with systematic improvements following project design principles.\n\n**Prevents**: Inconsistent design, broken responsive layouts, brand violations\n**Ensures**: Color palette consistency, mobile-first responsive design, professional appearance\n\n---\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Color Palette\n```css\nPrimary:    slate-blue (#475569, #64748b)\nAccent:     coral-orange (#fb923c, #f97316)\nBackground: warm-cream (#fef3c7, #fef9c3)\nGradien","body":"# Design Improvement Skill\n\n## Purpose\nStreamline design optimization with systematic improvements following project design principles.\n\n**Prevents**: Inconsistent design, broken responsive layouts, brand violations\n**Ensures**: Color palette consistency, mobile-first responsive design, professional appearance\n\n---\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Color Palette\n```css\nPrimary:    slate-blue (#475569, #64748b)\nAccent:     coral-orange (#fb923c, #f97316)\nBackground: warm-cream (#fef3c7, #fef9c3)\nGradients:  Smooth transitions for visual interest\n```\n\n### Typography\n```\nHierarchy: h1 > h2 > h3 > p (clear distinction)\nBody text: 16px+ for readability\nLine-height: Consistent spacing\nHero sections: Center-aligned\n```\n\n### Layout\n```\nApproach: Mobile-first responsive\nSpacing: Tailwind utilities (p-4, gap-6, etc.)\nAnimations: Framer Motion (smooth, not jarring)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Analyze Current Design\n\n```markdown\nIssues Checklist:\n- [ ] Color consistency problems?\n- [ ] Layout/alignment issues?\n- [ ] Typography hierarchy unclear?\n- [ ] Spacing inconsistent?\n- [ ] Responsive breakpoints broken?\n- [ ] Animations missing/excessive?\n```\n\n### 2. Propose Improvements (CARIO)\n\n```yaml\n📋 Context:\n  - Page: [Home/Projects/About/Speaking]\n  - Current state: [description]\n  - Issue: [what looks bad]\n\n❓ Problems:\n  1. [Color inconsistency]\n  2. [Poor spacing]\n  3. [Weak hierarchy]\n\n🎯 Options:\n  A. Minor tweaks (15 min, low impact)\n  B. Moderate redesign (30-45 min, medium impact)\n  C. Major overhaul (1-2 hours, high impact)\n\n💡 Recommendation: [Option B]\n  - Changes: [color X→Y, spacing p-4→p-6, add gradient]\n  - Reasoning: [balances improvement vs time]\n\n⚡ Impact:\n  - Files: [list]\n  - Testing: [responsive + visual]\n```\n\n### 3. Get User Confirmation\n\n```\nIdentified [N] design improvements for [Page] page:\n1. [Change 1]\n2. [Change 2]\n3. [Change 3]\n\nProceed with these improvements?\n```\n\n### 4. Implement Changes\n\n**Checklist**:\n- [ ] Update Tailwind classes\n- [ ] Ensure responsive (sm:, md:, lg: breakpoints)\n- [ ] Add/update Framer Motion animations\n- [ ] Maintain color palette\n- [ ] Follow typography hierarchy\n\n**Example**:\n```tsx\n// Before\n<div className=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-2xl\">Title</h1>\n</div>\n\n// After\n<div className=\"p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-warm-cream to-white\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-700 text-center mb-6\">\n    Title\n  </h1>\n</div>\n```\n\n### 5. Test Responsive Design\n\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n# Test at: Mobile (375px), Tablet (768px), Desktop (1280px)\n```\n\n**Visual checklist**:\n- [ ] Mobile (< 640px): Readable, no overflow\n- [ ] Tablet (640-1024px): Proper spacing\n- [ ] Desktop (> 1024px): Optimal layout\n- [ ] Animations: Smooth (60fps)\n\n### 6. Commit and Deploy\n\n```bash\nnpm run build  # Verify\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"style: improve [page] design with better spacing and colors\"\ngit push  # Auto-deploys to Vercel\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Improvements\n\n### Hero Section Enhancement\n```tsx\n// Before: Basic section\n<section className=\"py-12\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-3xl\">Welcome</h1>\n</section>\n\n// After: Enhanced with gradient + animation\n<section className=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-warm-cream via-white to-blue-50\">\n  <motion.div initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}>\n    <h1 className=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-600 to-slate-800 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-6\">\n      Welcome\n    </h1>\n  </motion.div>\n</section>\n```\n\n### Card Grid Optimization\n```tsx\n// Before: Fixed 3-column grid\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n  {projects.map(p => <Card {...p} />)}\n</div>\n\n// After: Responsive grid with hover animation\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8\">\n  {projects.map(p => (\n    <motion.div whileHover={{ scale: 1.03 }}>\n      <Card {...p} />\n    </motion.div>\n  ))}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Typography Hierarchy\n```tsx\n// Before: Flat hierarchy\n<h1>Title</h1>\n<p>Body text</p>\n\n// After: Clear hierarchy\n<h1 className=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 leading-tight\">\n  Title\n</h1>\n<p className=\"text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-prose\">\n  Body text\n</p>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n**Before committing**:\n\n```markdown\nVisual:\n- [ ] Colors match palette (slate-blue, coral-orange, warm-cream)\n- [ ] Spacing consistent (4px increments: p-4, p-6, p-8)\n- [ ] Typography hierarchy clear\n- [ ] Contrast WCAG AA (4.5:1 for text)\n\nResponsive:\n- [ ] Mobile (< 640px): Works\n- [ ] Tablet (640-1024px): Optimized\n- [ ] Desktop (> 1024px): Polished\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll\n- [ ] Touch targets ≥ 44px (mobile)\n\nPerformance:\n- [ ] Animations smooth (60fps)\n- [ ] No layout shift (CLS < 0.1)\n- [ ] Next.js Image component used\n\nConsistency:\n- [ ] Matches existing pages'' style\n- [ ] Follows Tailwind conventions\n- [ ] Framer Motion patterns consistent\n- [ ] Bilingual support maintained\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Breaking Responsive\n```tsx\n// Bad: Fixed width\n<div className=\"w-[1200px]\">Content</div>\n\n// Good: Responsive width\n<div className=\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\">Content</div>\n```\n\n### ❌ Inconsistent Colors\n```tsx\n// Bad: Random colors\n<div className=\"bg-red-500 text-purple-700\">Content</div>\n\n// Good: Follow palette\n<div className=\"bg-warm-cream text-slate-700\">Content</div>\n```\n\n### ❌ Poor Typography\n```tsx\n// Bad: Unreadable\n<p className=\"text-xs\">Important content</p>\n\n// Good: Readable\n<p className=\"text-base md:text-lg\">Important content</p>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Spacing Scale\n```\np-4  = 16px   p-8  = 32px\np-6  = 24px   p-12 = 48px\n```\n\n### Typography Scale\n```\ntext-base = 16px   text-2xl = 24px   text-4xl = 36px\ntext-lg   = 18px   text-3xl = 30px   text-5xl = 48px\n```\n\n### Responsive Breakpoints\n```\nsm: ≥ 640px (mobile landscape)\nmd: ≥ 768px (tablet)\nlg: ≥ 1024px (desktop)\nxl: ≥ 1280px (large desktop)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n- **content-update**: Content + design updates together\n- **deploy-check**: Pre-deployment design verification\n\n---\n\n**Version**: v1.1 | **Updated**: 2025-12-31\n**Project**: young-personal-site\n**Philosophy**: \"Design is not just what it looks like. Design is how it works.\" - Steve Jobs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:24.518Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing systematic design optimization and professional appearance","zh":"非常适合需要系统化设计优化和专业外观的 UI/UX Agents","ja":"UI/UX エージェントが体系的なデザイン最適化とプロフェッショナルな外観を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"시스템적인 디자인 최적화와 전문적인 외관이 필요한 UI/UX 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de UI/UX que necesitan optimización de diseño sistemática y apariencia profesional","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin d''une optimisation de conception systématique et d''un aspect professionnel","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agenten, die eine systematische Designoptimierung und ein professionelles Aussehen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de UI/UX que precisam de otimização de design sistemática e aparência profissional","ru":"Идеально для агентов UI/UX, которым необходима системная оптимизация дизайна и профессиональный вид","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء UI/UX الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين تصميم منهجي ومظهر محترف"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline design optimization with consistent color palettes, mobile-first responsive design, and brand compliance using CSS and project design principles","zh":"赋予代理人使用 CSS 和项目设计原则以实现一致的颜色调色板、移动优先的响应式设计和品牌合规的能力，从而简化设计优化","ja":"CSS とプロジェクト設計原則を使用して一貫したカラーパレット、モバイルファーストのレスポンシブデザイン、ブランドの準拠を実現することで、設計最適化を簡素化するエージェントの能力を付与","ko":"CSS와 프로젝트 디자인 원칙을 사용하여 일관된 색상 팔레트, 모바일 우선의 반응형 디자인 및 브랜드 준수를 구현하여 디자인 최적화를 간소화하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el diseño de manera eficiente con paletas de colores coherentes, diseño receptivo para móviles y cumplimiento de la marca utilizando CSS y principios de diseño de proyecto","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser l''optimisation de la conception avec des palettes de couleurs cohérentes, une conception réactive pour les appareils mobiles et un respect de la marque en utilisant CSS et les principes de conception de projet","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Designoptimierung mit konsistenten Farbpaletten, mobilem erstem responsivem Design und Markenkonformität unter Verwendung von CSS und Projekt-Designprinzipien zu rationalisieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o design de forma consistente com paletas de cores consistentes, design responsivo para dispositivos móveis e conformidade com a marca usando CSS e princípios de design de projetos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать дизайн посредством последовательных цветовых палитр, мобильного первого адаптивного дизайна и соблюдения бренда с использованием CSS и принципов проектирования","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين التصميم بطريقة متسقة باستخدام لوحات الألوان الثابتة والتصميم الاستجابي لأجهزة الجوال وامتثال العلامة التجارية باستخدام CSS ومبادئ تصميم المشاريع"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating design audits for brand violations","Generating consistent color schemes for web applications","Ensuring mobile-first responsive design for cross-device compatibility"],"zh":["自动化设计审计以查找品牌违规","为网页应用程序生成一致的色彩方案","确保跨设备兼容的移动优先响应式设计"],"ja":["ブランド違反の設計監査の自動化","Webアプリケーションの一貫したカラースキームの生成","クロスデバイス互換性のあるモバイルファーストのレスポンシブデザインの確保"],"ko":["브랜드 위반의 디자인 감사를 자동화","웹 애플리케이션의 일관된 색상 스킴 생성","크로스 디바이스 호환성을 가진 모바일 우선의 반응형 디자인 보장"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de diseño para violaciones de marca","Generar esquemas de colores coherentes para aplicaciones web","Garantizar diseño receptivo para móviles para la compatibilidad entre dispositivos"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits de conception pour les violations de marque","Générer des schémas de couleurs cohérents pour les applications web","Assurer une conception réactive pour les appareils mobiles pour la compatibilité entre les appareils"],"de":["Automatisierung von Design-Audits für Markenverletzungen","Generierung konsistenter Farbschemata für Webanwendungen","Sicherstellung des mobilen erstem responsiven Designs für die Kompatibilität zwischen Geräten"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de design para violações de marca","Gerar esquemas de cores consistentes para aplicações web","Garantir design responsivo para dispositivos móveis para compatibilidade entre dispositivos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты дизайна для нарушений бренда","Генерировать последовательные цветовые схемы для веб-приложений","Обеспечить адаптивный дизайн для мобильных устройств для совместимости между устройствами"],"ar":["أتمتة تدقيق تصميم لانتهاكات العلامة التجارية","توليد مخططات الألوان الثابتة للتطبيقات الويب","ضمان تصميم استجابي لأجهزة الجوال لتوافق الأجهزة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of CSS and design principles","Limited to visual design aspects, not functional implementation"],"zh":["需要 CSS 和设计原则的知识","仅限于视觉设计方面，不包括功能实现"],"ja":["CSS と設計原則の知識が必要","視覚的な設計面のみに限定され、機能の実装は含まない"],"ko":["CSS와 디자인 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요","시각적 디자인 측면만 해당되며, 기능 구현은 포함하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de CSS y principios de diseño","Limitado a aspectos de diseño visual, no a la implementación funcional"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en CSS et en principes de conception","Limité aux aspects de conception visuelle, et non à la mise en œuvre fonctionnelle"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von CSS und Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf visuelle Designaspekte, nicht auf funktionelle Implementierung"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de CSS e princípios de design","Limitado a aspectos visuais de design, não implementação funcional"],"ru":["Требует знания CSS и принципов дизайна","Ограничен аспектами визуального дизайна, не функциональной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة CSS ومبادئ التصميم","محدود بالجوانب البصرية للتصميم، وليس التنفيذ الوظيفي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e9e6f3bd4ce547313affded842657ac1d2eca61bacdf36a4a6cdec22a134689f","qualityScore":30}');
