INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jesseooxx/ERP-explore/erp-trade-doc', 'erp-trade-doc', 'jesseooxx', 'ERP-explore', 'community', 'erp-trade-doc jesseooxx ERP-explore community The erp-trade-doc skill provides technical documentation query capabilities for DataWin ERP trade module, benefiting developers and users seeking to understand business processes and system settings. ERP貿易模組文檔查詢，提供DataWin ERP貿易模組的業務流程、功能操作、系統設定等文檔 ERPトレードモジュールドキュメント検索、DataWin ERPトレードモジュールのビジネスプロセス、機能操作、システム設定などを提供 ERP 무역 모듈 문서 조회, DataWin ERP 무역 모듈의 비즈니스 프로세스, 기능 운영, 시스템 설정 등을 제공 erp-trade-doc es un módulo de comercio electrónico que proporciona funcionalidades de gestión de pedidos, compras y envíos. Ofrece una configuración flexible y una integración sencilla con sistemas existentes. erp-trade-doc est un module de commerce électronique qui offre des fonctionnalités de gestion de commandes, d''achats et d''expéditions. Il propose une configuration flexible et une intégration simple avec les systèmes existants. erp-trade-doc ist ein E-Commerce-Modul, das Funktionalitäten für die Verwaltung von Bestellungen, Einkäufen und Versand bietet. Es bietet eine flexible Konfiguration und eine einfache Integration in bestehende Systeme. O skill erp-trade-doc fornece documentação e suporte para o módulo de comércio do DataWin ERP, ajudando a resolver problemas e melhorar a eficiência. Умение erp-trade-doc предоставляет документацию и поддержку для торгового модуля DataWin ERP, помогая решать проблемы и повышать эффективность. المهارة erp-trade-doc توفر وثائق ودعم لوحدة التجارة في DataWin ERP، مما يساعد على حل المشكلات وتحقيق الكفاءة how to use erp-trade-doc erp-trade-doc setup guide DataWin ERP trade module documentation erp-trade-doc alternative erp-trade-doc vs DataWin ERP querying erp-trade-doc documentation erp-trade-doc installation what is erp-trade-doc erp-trade-doc technical documentation DataWin ERP trade module query ERP貿易模組文檔查詢 DataWin ERP 業務流程 功能操作 系統設定 AI工具 文檔查詢 關鍵字索引 程式開發參考 Reads keywords index from docs-index/trade-module/keywords.json Matches user queries to relevant chapters using keyword mapping Supports querying of business processes, such as order and procurement management Provides documentation on system settings, including company and permission configuration Offers insights into data structure and field explanations for developers erp-trade-doc is a technical skill that enables querying of DataWin ERP trade module documentation, covering topics such as business flows, functionality, and system configuration.');
