de GCP","Compatibilidad con la CLI de GCP para ejecutar comandos de facturación","Soporte para cuentas de facturación específicas mediante el parámetro ACCOUNT_ID","Ejecución de comandos de facturación con gcloud billing projects list","Integración con Claude Code para automatizar la infraestructura de GCP"],"fr":["Liste des projets de facturation pour un compte de facturation spécifique de GCP","Compatibilité avec la CLI GCP pour exécuter des commandes de facturation","Prise en charge des comptes de facturation spécifiques via le paramètre ACCOUNT_ID","Exécution des commandes de facturation avec gcloud billing projects list","Intégration avec Claude Code pour automatiser l''infrastructure GCP"],"de":["Liste der Abrechnungsprojekte für ein bestimmtes Abrechnungskonto von GCP","Kompatibilität mit der GCP-CLI für die Ausführung von Abrechnungsbefehlen","Unterstützung für bestimmte Abrechnungskonten über den ACCOUNT_ID-Parameter","Ausführung von Abrechnungsbefehlen mit gcloud billing projects list","Integration mit Claude Code für die Automatisierung der GCP-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Lista de projetos de contas de pagamento específicas","Automatização de projetos no GCP","Integração com o Claude Code","Suporte a contas de pagamento REPACT-MAIN e INKEUN-PERSONAL","Execução de comandos CLI para listar projetos"],"ru":["Список проектов конкретных платежных счетов","Автоматизация проектов в GCP","Интеграция с Claude Code","Поддержка платежных счетов REPACT-MAIN и INKEUN-PERSONAL","Выполнение команд CLI для просмотра проектов с помощью ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["قائمة المشاريع لحسابات الدفع المحددة","تأشير المشاريع في GCP","دمج مع Claude Code","دعم حسابات الدفع REPACT-MAIN و INKEUN-PERSONAL","تشغيل أوامر CLI لاستعراض المشاريع مع آداه إلكترونية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use gcp-billing-projects","gcp-billing-projects setup guide","gcp billing project management","gcloud billing projects list","gcp-billing-projects alternative","automating gcp infrastructure with gcp-billing-projects"],"zh":["GCP Billing 项目","Claude Code AI工具","结算账户","项目列表查询","gcloud 命令行工具","自动化","开发效率"],"ja":["GCP 請求プロジェクト","Claude Code AIエージェント","請求アカウント","プロジェクト一覧の取得","gcloud コマンドラインツール","自動化","開発効率"],"ko":["GCP 결제 프로젝트","Claude Code AI 에이전트","결제 계정","프로젝트 목록 조회","gcloud 명령줄 도구","자동화","개발 효율"],"es":["gcp billing projects","claude code","automatización de infraestructura","cuentas de facturación de GCP","gcloud billing projects list","ACCOUNT_ID","proyectos de facturación de GCP"],"fr":["gcp billing projects","claude code","automatisation d''infrastructure","comptes de facturation GCP","gcloud billing projects list","ACCOUNT_ID","projets de facturation GCP"],"de":["gcp billing projects","claude code","automatisierung von infrastruktur","gcp-abrechnungskonten","gcloud billing projects list","ACCOUNT_ID","gcp-abrechnungsprojekte"],"pt":["gcp-billing-projects","automatizar projetos gcp","claude code","contas de pagamento gcp","lista de projetos gcp"," REPACT-MAIN","INKEUN-PERSONAL"],"ru":["gcp-billing-projects","автоматизация проектов gcp","claude code","платежные счета gcp","список проектов gcp","REPACT-MAIN","INKEUN-PERSONAL","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["gcp-billing-projects","تأشير مشاريع gcp","claude code","حسابات الدفع gcp","قائمة المشاريع gcp","REPACT-MAIN","INKEUN-PERSONAL","آداه إلكترونية"]}},"owner":"kubony","repo":"openclaw-gcp-setup","repoPath":"kubony/openclaw-gcp-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.311Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gcp-billing-projects","description":"GCP 결제 계정 프로젝트 목록","bodyPreview":"# GCP 결제 계정 프로젝트 목록\n\n특정 결제 계정에 연결된 프로젝트 목록을 조회합니다.\n\n## 사용법\n\n```\n/gcp-billing-projects                    # REPACT-MAIN (기본)\n/gcp-billing-projects 0142CF-B4119B-FAE5BD  # 특정 결제 계정\n```\n\n## 결제 계정 ID\n\n| 이름 | ACCOUNT_ID |\n|------|------------|\n| REPACT-MAIN | 0142CF-B4119B-FAE5BD |\n| INKEUN-PERSONAL | 01BE16-87467F-4D3098 |\n\n## 실행할 명령어\n\n```bash\n# 기본: REPACT-MAIN\ngcloud billing projects list --billing-account=0142CF-B4119B-FAE5BD\n\n# 또는 인자로 받은 결제 계정\ngcloud billing projects list --billing-account=ACCOUN","body":"# GCP 결제 계정 프로젝트 목록\n\n특정 결제 계정에 연결된 프로젝트 목록을 조회합니다.\n\n## 사용법\n\n```\n/gcp-billing-projects                    # REPACT-MAIN (기본)\n/gcp-billing-projects 0142CF-B4119B-FAE5BD  # 특정 결제 계정\n```\n\n## 결제 계정 ID\n\n| 이름 | ACCOUNT_ID |\n|------|------------|\n| REPACT-MAIN | 0142CF-B4119B-FAE5BD |\n| INKEUN-PERSONAL | 01BE16-87467F-4D3098 |\n\n## 실행할 명령어\n\n```bash\n# 기본: REPACT-MAIN\ngcloud billing projects list --billing-account=0142CF-B4119B-FAE5BD\n\n# 또는 인자로 받은 결제 계정\ngcloud billing projects list --billing-account=ACCOUNT_ID\n```\n\n## 출력 형식\n\n```\n## [BILLING_ACCOUNT_NAME] 연결된 프로젝트\n\n| PROJECT_ID | NAME | BILLING_ENABLED |\n|------------|------|-----------------|\n| patent-481206 | patent | yes |\n| seo-knowledge-hub | Seo Knowledge Hub | yes |\n| ... | ... | ... |\n\n---\n총 N개 프로젝트\n```\n\n## 관련 스킬\n\n| 스킬 | 용도 |\n|------|------|\n| `/gcp-billing-accounts` | 결제 계정 목록 |\n| `/gcp-project-status [project-id]` | 프로젝트 리소스 상태 |\n| `/gcp-billing` | 비용 조회 (Billing Export 필요) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:33.837Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Management Agents requiring automated GCP billing project retrieval and management.","zh":"适用于需要自动检索和管理GCP计费项目的云管理代理","ja":"GCP請求プロジェクトの自動化された取得および管理が必要なクラウド管理エージェントに最適","ko":"자동으로 GCP 요금 청구 프로젝트를 검색하고 관리해야 하는 클라우드 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de Cloud que requieren la recuperación y administración automatizada de proyectos de facturación de GCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion Cloud nécessitant la récupération et la gestion automatisées des projets de facturation GCP.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Management-Agents, die eine automatisierte Abruf- und Verwaltung von GCP-Abrechnungsprojekten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Nuvem que exigem recuperação e gerenciamento automatizados de projetos de faturamento do GCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления облаком, требующих автоматизированного извлечения и управления проектами выставления счетов GCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة السحابة التي تتطلب استرجاع و إدارة مشاريع فواتير جوجل سحابة تلقائيين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently list projects linked to specific GCP billing accounts using gcloud commands, streamlining billing administration and project organization through protocols like gcloud billing projects list.","zh":"赋予代理能够使用gcloud命令高效地列出与特定GCP计费账户关联的项目，从而通过gcloud billing projects list等协议简化计费管理和项目组织","ja":"gcloudコマンドを使用して特定のGCP請求アカウントにリンクされたプロジェクトを効率的にリストできるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、gcloud billing projects listなどのプロトコルを介して請求管理とプロジェクトの組織化を合理化","ko":"에이전트가 gcloud 명령을 사용하여 특정 GCP 요금 청구 계정에 연결된 프로젝트를 효율적으로 목록으로 표시할 수 있도록 하여 gcloud billing projects list와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 요금 관리 및 프로젝트 조직을 간소화","es":"Permite a los agentes enumerar proyectos de forma eficiente vinculados a cuentas de facturación de GCP específicas utilizando comandos gcloud, simplificando la administración de facturación y la organización de proyectos a través de protocolos como gcloud billing projects list.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lister de manière efficace les projets liés à des comptes de facturation GCP spécifiques en utilisant des commandes gcloud, rationalisant ainsi l''administration de la facturation et l''organisation des projets via des protocoles comme gcloud billing projects list.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Projekte effizient aufzulisten, die mit bestimmten GCP-Abrechnungskonten verknüpft sind, indem sie gcloud-Befehle verwenden, wodurch die Abrechnungsverwaltung und die Projekorganisation durch Protokolle wie gcloud billing projects list gestreamlined werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a listar projetos vinculados a contas de faturamento do GCP específicas usando comandos gcloud, racionalizando a administração de faturamento e organização de projetos por meio de protocolos como gcloud billing projects list.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно пере