INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('air-gapped/cooked/http-patterns', 'http-patterns', 'air-gapped', 'cooked', 'community', 'http-patterns air-gapped cooked community http-patterns is a Go-based rendering proxy that serves raw documents as styled HTML. It implements Go 1.22+ HTTP handler patterns, providing developers with a structured way to handle method-based routing and path parameters for building web services and proxies. HTTP Patterns 是一个渲染代理，支持将原始文档作为样式化的 HTML 提供。它使用 Go 1.22+ 和 ServeMux 方法路由 HTTP パターンは、元のドキュメントをスタイル化された HTML として提供するレンダリング プロキシです。Go 1.22+ と ServeMux メソッド ルーティングを使用 HTTP 패턴은 원시 문서를 스타일화된 HTML로 제공하는 렌더링 프록시입니다. Go 1.22+ 및 ServeMux 메서드 라우팅을 사용 http-patterns es un proxy de renderizado que sirve documentos sin procesar como HTML con estilo, utilizando Go 1.22+ y convenciones de proyecto específicas. http-patterns est un proxy de rendu qui sert des documents bruts comme HTML stylisé, en utilisant Go 1.22+ et des conventions de projet spécifiques. http-patterns ist ein Rendering-Proxy, der rohe Dokumente als gestyltes HTML serviert, unter Verwendung von Go 1.22+ und projektspezifischen Konventionen. O http-patterns é uma proxy de renderização que serve documentos brutos como HTML estilizado com Go 1.22+ e ServeMux. ИИ Агенты http-patterns - это рендеринг-прокси, который служит сырыми документами как HTML с помощью Go 1.22+ и ServeMux. http-patterns هو وكيل إعداد عرض المستندات الخام كأحمل HTML المنسق باستخدام Go 1.22+ و ServeMux. http-patterns Go 1.22 how to use http-patterns Go ServeMux method routing http-patterns path parameters http-patterns vs gorilla mux http-patterns setup guide Go 1.22 HTTP handler patterns r.PathValue example what is http-patterns http-patterns install HTTP Patterns AIエージェント Go 1.22+ ServeMux 方法路由 路径参数 HTTP 处理 渲染代理 样式化 HTML Go 1.22 ServeMux Method Routing using HTTP verb prefixes (e.g., ''GET /healthz'') Eliminates manual HTTP method checks within handler functions Native path parameter extraction via r.PathValue() Supports wildcard path segments using the ''{path...}'' syntax Functions as a rendering proxy to serve raw documents as styled HTML http-patterns is a Go package providing project-specific conventions and patterns for HTTP handlers. It leverages Go 1.22''s enhanced http.ServeMux to enable declarative routing with HTTP verb prefixes and built-in path parameter extraction.');
